<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Apocalipsa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Apocalipsa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Apocalipsa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Apo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Apocalipsa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ahurhirea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Discupirirea al Isus Hristos, tsi Dumnidzãlu lji-u deadi tra s-lã spunã a huzmichearilor a lui lucrili tsi va undzeascã curundu, aestã u-featsi shtiut cu pitritsearea a anghilui a lui a huzmichearlui a lui Ioan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:28-29">Dan 2:28-29</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:45">45</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Ioanul mãrtirisi zborlu al Dumnidzãu sh-mãrtiria al Isus Hristos sh-tuti cãti vidzu. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Cahara di atsel cai cãntã sh-atselji cai ascultã zborlu a prufitsiiljei sh-veaglji atseali tsi suntu scriati tu nãsã, cã chirolu ma aproachi!<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salutãri sh-Mãriri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Ioanul, lã scrii a shapti biseritslor tu Asia: Har pristi voi sh-pace di la atsel tsi easti, tsi eara sh-atsel cai yini sh-di la shapti duhurili, cai suntu nãintea a thronlui a lu, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />sh-di la Isus Hristolu, martir pistimen, protlu-amintat dit mortsã sh-caplu a amiradzlor a loclui. Elu nã vru sh-nã featsi liberi di amãrtiili a noastri cu sãndzili a lui, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />sh-nã featsi amirãrilji sh-preftsã trã Dumnidzãlu sh-Tatãl a lui. A lui s-lji hibã mãrirea sh-putearea tu eta a etilor! Amin!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Ex 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:6">Isa 61:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:5">1 Pet 2:5</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 2:9">9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />“Ia, elu ma yini cu niori</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">sh-cathi ocljiu va l-veadã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">sh-ma multu atselji tsi lu ntsãparã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">sh-tuti soili a loclui va plãngã trã itia a lui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">Ie, Amin!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Mini escu Alfa sh-Omega,” dzãtsi Domnul, Dumnidzãlu, “atsel tsi easti, tsi eara, sh-tsi yini, Tut-pututlu.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Viziunea al Ioan trã Hristolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Mini, Ioanul, fratili a vostru shi pãrtash tu munduiri, la amirãriljea sh-tu arãvdarea al Isus, fui tu insula tsi s-acljeamã Patmos trã itia a zborlui al Dumnidzãu sh-trã itia a mãririljei al Isus. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Tu dzua a Domnului fui arãchit tu Duh sh-avdzãi dupã mini unã boatsi analtã ca unã trumpetã, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />cai dzãtsea: “Atsea tsi vedz scrii tu unã carti sh-pitreats-u a shapti biseritslor: tu Efes, tu Smirna, tu Pergam, tu Tiatira, tu Sarda, tu Filadelfia sh-tu Laoditsea.” <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Mini mi turnai s-ved a cui eara boatsea cai zbura cu mini. Sh-cãndu mi turnai, vidzui shapti shindãnji di furii <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />sh-tu mesea a shindãnjilor, un tsi undzea ca Hiljiu a Omlui, nviscut cu un stranjiu lungu pãnã la cicioari sh-anvãrligat cu un brãn di furii tu cheptu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">10:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:2">Ezc 9:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Caplu sh-perlu a lui eara albã ca lãna icã-ca neaua sh-ocljilji a lui ca fleaca a foclui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Cicioarili a lui undzea ca bãcãrã curat sh-arushãt ca dit cireap sh-boatsea a lui ca vãzirea a apilor atseali multi. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Tu mãna a lui atsea ndreapta avea shapti steali sh-dit gura a lui ishea unã spatã struxitã cu doauã tãljituri, sh-fatsa a lui lunjina ca soarili cu tut fuchia a lui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:20">Apo 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:1">2:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:2">Isa 49:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Cãndu lu vidzui, cãdzui la cicioarili a lui ca mortu. Atumtsea elu bãgã mãna a lui atsea ndreapta pristi mini sh-dzãsi: “Nu ti aspari! Mini escu atsel di prota sh-atsel di soni. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Mini escu atsel yiu! Earam mortu, ma ia, tora escu yiu tu eta a etilor, sh-mini li am cljeili a moartiljei sh-a Colasiljei. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Trã atsea, scrii-li atseali tsi vidzush, atseali tsi suntu sh-atseali tsi va si s-facã dupã aesti,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:6">Isa 48:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:1">2:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />mistiryiul atsilor shapti steali, tsi vidzush tu nandreapta a mea, sh-atsilor shapti shindãnji di furii. Atseali shapti steali suntu anghilji atsilor shapti biseritsi, sh-atseali shapti shindãnji tsi vidzush suntu shapti biseritsli.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:16">Apo 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:1">2:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:1">3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Efes scrii-lji: Aesti dzãtsi atsel tsi tsãni di shapti stealili tu nandreapta a lui sh-atsel tsi imnã tu mesea di shapti shindãnji di furii. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Mini li shtiu faptili a tali, copuslu a tãu sh-arãvdarea a ta. Shtiu cã tini nu pots s-lji aravdzã arãlji sh-lji bãgash tu provã atselji cai dzãc cã suntu apostulji, ma nu suntu sh-tini lji aflash arãdioshi. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Tini arãvdash sh-ai arãvdat munduirili trã hãtãrea a numãljei a mea sh-nu ti curmash.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ma am un tsiva contra tini, cã u-alãsash vrearea a ta di prota. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Trã atsea, adu-aminti cã, di iu cãdzushi nghios, mitãnjiuseati sh-fã faptili di ma nãinti. Macã nu ti mitãnjiuseshti, va yin trãoarã la tini sh-va-u mutã shindanea a ta di loc. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ma tini ai aestã bunã, cã aurãshti faptili a Nicolaitsilor, tsi li aurãscu sh-mini. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor. Atsilui tsi nichiseashti va lji dau s-mãcã di pomlu a banãljei, tsi easti tu paradislu a Dumnidzãlui.”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Smirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Smirna scrii-lji: Aestã dzãtsi atsel di prota sh-atsel di soni, tsi fu mortu shi s-turnã tu banã. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Mini shtiu munduirea a ta sh-urfanjea a ta, ma tini eshti avut. Shtiu sh-blãsteamili atsilor tsi dzãc cã suntu Iudei, ma nu suntu, di contra elji suntu unã sinagogã a Satanlui. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Nu ti aspari dip di atsea tsi va ti mundueshti. Ia, draclu va arucã niscãntsã di voi tu hapsi tra s-vã bagã tu provã sh-voi va avets munduiri di dzatsi dzãli. S-hii pistimen pãnã la moarti sh-va tsã dau curuna a banãljei. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor. Cai nichiseashti nu va si s-pligueascã dip di a doaua moarti.”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Pergam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Pergam scrii-lji: Aestã dzãtsi atsel tsi ari spata struxitã cu doauã tãljituri. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Mini shtiu iu bãnedz, aclo iu easti thronlu al Satan. Ma tini tsãnji ghini numa a mea sh-nu u-ai alipidat pistea la mini sh-tu dzãlili cãndu Antipa, martirlu a meu pistimen, s-vãtãmã la voi, aclo iu bãneadzã Satanlu. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ma am niscãnti lucri contra tini: Ai atsia niscãntsã tsi tsãn nvitsãtura al Balaam, cai u-nvitsã Balacul s-bagã ncheadic nãintea a hiljilor al Israel tra s-mãcã curbãnsita a idoljilor shi sã s-da tu curvãrii. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ashã tini ai sh-niscãntsã tsi tsãn nvitsãturili a Nicolaitsilor. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Mitãnjiusea-ti cã aljumtrea va yin curundu la tini sh-va mi-alumtã cu elji cu spata a gurãljei a mea. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor. Atsilui tsi nichiseashti va lji dau s-mãcã di mana atsea ascumta sh-va lji dau unã chitricã albã sh-pristi nãsã easti scriatã unã numã noauã, tsi nu u shti vãrã dicãt mash atsel tsi u ljea.”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Tiatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Tiatira scrii-lji: Aestã dzãtsi Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui, atsel cai ari ocljilji ca fleaca a foclui sh-cicioarili a lui lunjineadzã ca bãcãrea curatã. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Mini li shtiu faptili a tali, vrearea, pistea, huzmitipsirea sh-arãvdarea a ta. Faptili a tali atseali di ma nãpoi suntu ma multi di atseali di ma nãinti. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ma am niscãnti lucri contra tini, cã u alashi muljearea Iezebela, tsi s-acljeamã prufiteasã, sh-nveatsi shi s-arãdã huzmichearlji a melji s-putãnseascã shi s-mãca di curbãnsirea a idoljilor. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Mini lj-am dat chiro s-mitãnjiuseascã di putãnsirea a ljei, ma ea nu vru s-mitãnjiuseascã. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Mini va u aruc atsea tu un pat di munduiri sh-atselji tsi ncalcã curuna cu nãsã va lji arucã tu mari munduiri, macã elji nu s-mitãnjiuseascã trã faptili a ljei. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Mini va li agudescu cilimenjlji a ljei cu moarti. Sh-tuti biseritsli va s-aducheascã cã mini escu atsel tsi caftã mintili sh-ininjli, sh-mini va arãsplãtescu cathiunu di voi dupã faptili a lor. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Ma a voauã sh-alantsãlor cai suntu tu Tiatira, tsi nu tsãnets nvitsãturili a ljei shi nu avets cunuscut ‘ahãndamea al Satan,’ cum u acljeamã elji, mini dzãc: ‘Nu va bagã pristi voi altã greutati, <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />ma tsãnets-vã la atsea tsi avets pãnã cãndu s-yin.’ <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Atsilui tsi nichiseashti sh-li veaglji pãnã tu soni faptili a meali, mini va lji-dau puteari pristi natsiunili. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Elu va domneascã atselji cu un scheptru di her sh-va li dãrãm ca vasi di lãschi, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />ashãtsi di cum loai autoritati di la Tatãl a meu, sh-va lji dau a lui steaua a dimineatsãljei. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor.”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Sarda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Sarda scrii-lji: Aestã dzãtsi atsel tsi tsãni di shapti duhurili a Dumnidzãlui shi shapti stealili. Mini li shtiu faptili a tali, tini ai numa cã bãnedz, ma eshti mortu. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Dishteaptã-ti! Nvãrtushea atseali tsi au armasã, tsi suntu etinji trã muriri, cã nu li am aflatã faptili a tali mpliniti nãintea a Dumnidzãlui a meu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Adu aminti, tsi loash sh-tsi avdzãsh, veaglji-li sh-mitãnjiuseati. Trã atsea, macã nu va stai dishtiptat, va yin ca fur sh-tini nu va ljeai di hãbari cã pi tsi oarã va yin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:5">Apo 2:5</ref>,<ref loc="REV 2:16">16</ref>,<ref loc="REV 2:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat 24:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luc 12:39-40</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ma, ai niscãnti numi tu Sarda tsi nu li pãnĝãnirã stranjili a lor sh-elji va imnã cu mini nviscuts cu stranji albi, cã suntu axii. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Atsel tsi nichiseashti va si s-nveascã cu stranji albi sh-mini nu va u-ashtergu numa a lui di cartea a banãljei, ma va s-mãrtirsescu numa a lui nãintea a Tatãl a meu sh-nãintea a anghilor a lui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:18">Apo 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:4">4:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:32-33">Ex 32:32-33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor.”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Filadefia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Filadelfia scrii-lji: Aestã dzãtsi Sãmtul, Alihioslu, atsel tsi ari cljeaia al David, atsel tsi discljidi sh-vãrã nu ncljidi, sh-atsel tsi ncljidi sh-vãrã nu discljidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:22">Isa 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">Iob 12:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Mini li shtiu faptili a tali. Ia, alãsai nãintea a ta unã ushi discljisã sh-vãrã nu poati si u-ncljidã, cã tini ai putsãnã fuchii sh-u vigljeash zborlu a meu sh-nu u-ai alipidat numa a mea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:2">Apo 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:1">3:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:9">1 Cor 16:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Ia, mini va lji dau niscãntsã di sinagoga al Satan, tsi dzãc cã suntu Iudei sh-nu suntu, ma arãd. Mini va facã tsi s-yin shi si s-apleacã la cicioarili a tali shi s-ljea di hãbari cã mini ti vrui. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Metsi tini vigljeash zborlu s-aravdzã, sh-mini va ti veglji tini di oara a provãljei, tsi va yin pristi tutã lumea, tra s-lã bagã tu provã locuitorlji a loclui. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Mini ma yinã troarã! Tsãnã-ti la atsea tsi ai, tsi nitsiunã s-nu su ljea curuna a ta. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Atsel tsi nichiseashti va s-lu fac unã coloanã tu templul a Dumnidzãlui a meu sh-pute atselji nu va s-dispartã di aclo. Mini va scriu pri nãsu numa a Dumnidzãlui a meu sh-numa a cãsãbãlui al Dumnidzãu a meu, noulu Ierusalem, tsi va s-dipunã dit tser di la Dumnidzãlu a meu, sh-mini va u-scriu pristi atsel numa a mea atsea noauã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:1">Apo 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 48:35">Ezc 48:35</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa 62:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor.”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Bisearicãljei tu Laoditsea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“A anghilui a bisearicãljei tu Laoditsea scrii-lji: Aesti dzãtsi Aminu, Martirlu pistimen sh alihios, Atsel tsi apãrnji adrarea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Mini li shtiu faptili a tali, tsi tini nu eshti nitsi arcuros nitsi hertu. Canda s-earai arcuros icã hertu! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ashãtsi, metsi eshti cãlduros sh-nu eshti nitsi arcuros sh-nitsi hertu, va s-vom dit gura a mea. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Tini dzãtsi: ‘Escu avut sh-escu avutsit sh-nu am ananghi di tsiva.’ Ma nu shtii cã eshti curbisit, mãrat, oarfãn, orbu sh-dispuljeat.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:8">Hos 12:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ti urnipsescu tsi s-acumpãri di la mini furii chischinatã tu foc tra s-ti avutseshti, shi stranji albi s-ti nveshti tra s-nu si s-veadã arushinea a guleatsãljei a ta. S-acumpãri sh-melhem tsi s-aundzã ocljilji a tãlji tra s-vedz. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Mini tuts atselji tsi li voi lji vãrghescu sh-lji disiplinescu. Trã atsea, aspun zel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:32">1 Cor 11:32</ref>.</char></note> sh-mitãnjiuseati! <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Ia, mini stau la ushi sh-asunã. Macã vãrã ascultã boatsea a mea sh-discljidi usha, va intru nãuntru, va mãcã tsinã cu nãsu sh-elu cu mini. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Atsilui tsi nichiseashti, va lj-dau si s-apunã cu mini tu thronlu a meu, ashãtsi di cum sh-mini nichisii shi shidzui cu Tatãl a meu tu thronlu a lui. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã atsea tsi Duhlu lã dzãtsi a biseritslor.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Viziunea a Thronlui tu Tser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Dupã aesti, ia, mini mutrii unã poartã discljisã tu tser sh-boatsea atsea di prota ca trumpetã cai avdzãi si zbura cu mini, dzãcãnda: “Alinã-ti aoa sh-va ts-aspun atseali tsi prindi s-undzeascã dupã aesti.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Trãoarã mi aflai tu Duh sh-ia, un thron eara tu tser sh-un cai shidea apunat pri nãsu. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Atsel cai shidea apunat undzea ca unã cheatrã di iaspu sh-sardiu, sh-un curcubeu anvãrliga di thron, tsi lji undzea a smeraldului. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Anvãrliga di thron eara patrusprãyinghits di thronuri, sh-pri thronuri eara apunats patrusprãyinghits di aushi nviscuts cu stranji albi sh-cu curunji di furii pristi cap. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Dit thron ishea sfulguri, botsi sh-bumbunidzãri. Nãintea a thronlui eara shapti shindãnji di foc apreasi, cai suntu shapti duhurili al Dumnidzãu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:2">Isa 11:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Nãintea a thronlui eara unã ca amari di yilii tsi lji undzea al cristalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Tu mesea a thronlui sh-dianvãrliga a lui eara patru fãpturi yii, tsi eara mplini di oclji dinãinti sh-dinãpoi. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Fãptura atsea di prota undzea ca ljundarlu, fãptura atsea a doaua undzea ca yitselu, fãptura atsea a treia avea fatsa ca a omlui, fãptura atsea a patrua undzea ca vulturlu cai azboairã. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Di patru fãpturili atseali yii avea cathiunã cãti shasi arichi sh-anvãrliga sh-di nãuntru eara mplini di oclji, sh-nu pãpsea pute dzua sh-noaptea dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Sãmtu, Sãmtu, Sãmtu easti Domnul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Dumnidzãlu, atsel Tutãpututul, atsel tsi eara, atsel tsi easti sh-atsel tsi yini.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Di multi ori fãpturili atseali yii lji dãdea mãriri, tinjii sh-hãristisiri atsilui cai easti apunat tu thron cai bãneadzã tu eta a etilor. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />Atselji patrusprãyinghitslji di aushi cãdea pri-dintsã nãintea atsilui tsi eara apunat pri thron, shi si ncljina atsilui tsi bãneadzã tu eta a etilor, sh-li arca curunjili a lor nãintea a thronlui, dzãcãnda:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Axiu eshti, Doamne sh-Dumnidzãlu a nostru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">s-ljeai mãrirea, tinjia sh-fuchia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">cã tini li adrash tuti lucrili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">sh-trã vrearea a ta eara sh-suntu adrati!”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Njelu Discljisi Cartea Vulusitã cu Shapti Vuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Atumtsea, vidzui tu nandreapta atsilui tsi shidea pri thron, unã carti scriat di nãuntru sh-di nafoarã sh-vulusit cu shapti vuli. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Vidzui sh-un anghil puternic cai hãbãrsi cu boatsi analtã: “Cai easti axiu s-discljidã cartea shi s-li disfacã vulili a ljei?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ma vãrã, nitsi tu tser, nitsi pri loc sh-nitsi sum loc, nu putea s-u discljidea cartea shi s-videa la nãsã. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ashãtsi, mini plãndzeam cu amãreatsã cã nu s-aflã vãrã axiu s-discljidea shi s-mutrea cartea. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Atumtsea un di aushlji nj-dzãsi: “Nu plãndzi! Ia, ljundarlu tsi easti di soia al Iuda, arãdãtzina al David, nichisi s-discljidã cartea shi shapti vulili a ljei.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Atumtsea vidzui tu mesea a thronlui, a patru fãpturilor sh-a aushlor cã eara un Njel ca tãljeat, cai avea shapti coarni shi shapti oclji, cai suntu atseali shapti duhurili al Dumnidzãu, pitricut pristi tut loclu. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Elu vini sh-lo cartea di nandreapta atsilui cai shidea apunat pri thron. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Dupã tsi u-lo cartea, di patruli fãpturili atseali yii sh-atselji patrusprãyinghits di aushi cãdzurã pri-dintsã nãintea a Njelui, avãnda cathiunu unã harpã sh-vasi di furii mplini cu timeamã, cai suntu rugãciunjili a popului sãmtu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Elji cãnta un cãntic nou, dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Axiu eshti s-ljeai cartea</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">shi s-disfatsi vulili a ljei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">cã, tini ti tãljeashi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">sh-cu sãndzili a tãu arãscumpãrash trã Dumnidzãlu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">oaminji di tuti soili, limbili, populjilji sh-fãrili.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Tini lji ai faptã elji ca unã amirãrii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">sh-preftsã trã Dumnidzãlu a nostru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">sh-elji va s-domneascã pri loc.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Atumtsea vidzui sh-avdzãi boatsea a multor anghilji anvãrliga di thron, a fãpturilor atsilor yiilor sh-a aushlor, sh-numirlu a lor eara njilji di njilji sh-multi njilji. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Elji dzãtsea cu boatsi analtã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Axiu easti Njelu atsel tãljeatlu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">s-ljea fuchii, aveari, frunimeatsã, puteari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">tinjii, mãriri sh-ghinicuvintari!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Atumtsea avdzãi tuti fãpturili cai suntu tu tser, pristi loc, sum loc, atseali tsi suntu tu amari sh-tuti atseali tsi suntu tu nãsi, cai dzãtsea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Atsilui tsi sheadi pri thron sh-a Njelui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">s-lji hibã alãvdarea, tinjia, mãrirea sh-putearea</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">tu eta a etilor!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Patruli fãpturili atseali yii dzãtsea: “Amin!” Atumtsea aushlji cãdzurã pri-dintsã sh-alãvdarã.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Discljiderea atsilor Shasi Vuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Deapoea vidzui Njelu tsi discljisi unã di atseali shapti vuli sh-avdzãi unã di patru fãpturili atseali yii cai dzãtsea cu boatsi bumbunidzatã: “Haidi.” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Sh-ia, vidzui un cal albu sh-atsel tsi cãlãrea avea un arcu, sh-atsilui lji si deadi unã curuni. Elu ishi nichisinda shi s-dusi nãpoi s-nichisea.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Cãndu Njelu discljisi vula a doaua, avdzãi fãptura a doaua tsi dzãtsea: “Haidi.” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Atumtsea ishi afoarã un altu cal roshu-fleac sh-atsilui tsi cãlãrea lji si deadi s-mutea pacea di pristi loc, tsi oaminjlji si s-vãtãma cu un-alantu. A lui lji si deadi unã spatã mari.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Cãndu Njelu discljisi vula a treia, avdzãi fãptura a treia tsi dzãtsea: “Haidi!” Sh-ia, vidzui un cal laiu sh-atsel tsi cãlãrea avea unã zigã tu mãna a lui. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Deapoea avdzãi unã boatsi tu mesea a patru fãpturilor tsi dzãtsea: “Unã mizurã di grãn ti un denar sh-trei mizuri di ordzu ti un denar, ma nu nji aspardzã untulemlu sh-yinlu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">un denar easti plãtirea tu unã dzuã</char></note><verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Cãndu Njelu discljisi vula a patrua, avdzãi boatsea a fãpturiljei a patrua tsi dzãtsea: “Haidi!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Sh-ia, vidzui un cal gãlbinos sh-atsel tsi cãlãrea u-avea numa “Moartea” sh-dupã nãsu yinea Colasea. A lor lji si deadi puteari trã vãtãmari un a patrua parti a loclui cu spatã, cu foami, cu hulerã sh-cu agrinjili a loclui.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Cãndu Njelu discljisi vula a tsintsea, vidzui sum altar suflitli atsilor tsi eara tãljeats trã itia a zborlui al Dumnidzãu sh-trã itia a mãririljei tsi avea datã. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Elji aurla cu boatsi analtã, dzãcãnda: “Pãnã cãndu Doamne, Sãmtu sh-Alihioslu, nu giuditsi sh-nu ljeai dhichi trã sãndzili a nostru di atselji tsi bãneadzã pri loc?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />A cathiunui lã-si deadi un stranjiu albu sh-lã si dzãsi s-ashteaptã ninga putsãn chiro, pãnã cãndu si mplinea numirlu atsilor cai au huzmitipsit deadun sh-a fratsilor a lor tsi prindea si s-vãtãma ashãtsi ca elji.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Cãndu s-discljisi vula a shasea, s-featsi un cutrembur mari sh-soarili s-featsi laiu ca un sac di lãnã sh-luna ntreagã s-featsi ca sãndzili. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Stealili a tserlui cãdzurã pri loc, ashãtsi ca hiclu tsi alasã hitslji a lui nicoapti s-cadã, dupã tsi easti ascuturat di furtuna. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Tserlu s-trapsi ca unã carti anvãrligatã, sh-tuts muntsãlji sh-insulili si strãmutarã dit loclu a lor. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Atumtsea amiradzlji a loclui, mãrlji, cumandantsãlji, avutslji, vãrtoshlji, tuts sclayilji sh-tuts liberi, s-ascumsirã prit pishtirei sh-prit shcãnghili a muntsãlor. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Elji dzãtsea a muntsãlor sh-a shcãnghilor: “Cãdets pristi noi sh-ascundets-nã di fatsa atsilui tsi sta pri thron sh-di nãrirea a Njelui, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />cã vini dzua atsea marea a nãririljei a lui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">niscãnti manuscrisi au scriat “nãrirea a lor”.</char></note> sh-cai poati si sta pri cicioari?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Israelitslji Atselji Vulusits</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Dupã aestã, vidzui patru anghilji stãnda tu patru chioshili a loclui sh-tsãnãnda patru vimturili a loclui tra s-nu sufla vimtu pri loc, pri amari sh-pristi vãrã pom. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Deapoea vidzui un altu anghil cai s-alina di la rãsãrit sh-avea vula al Dumnidzãu atsilui yiu. Elu lã grãi cu boatsi analtã atsilor patru anghilji, a cui lã si fu datã si zãrãsea loclu sh-amarea. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Deapoea adãvgã: “Nu zãrãsits loclu, amarea sh-ponjilji pãnã cãndu s-lã vulusim pri frãmti huzmichearlji a Dumnidzãlui a nostru.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Atumtsea avdzãi numirlu atsilor tsi eara vulusits: unã sutã patrudzãtsi patru di njilji di vulusits dit tuti soili a hiljilor al Israel.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Dit soia al Iuda doisprãdzatsi di njilji di vulusits,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">di soia al Ruben doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">dit soia al Gad doisprãdzatsi di njilji,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />dit soia al Asher doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">dit soia al Neftal doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">dit soia al Manase doisprãdzatsi di njilji,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />dit soia al Simeon doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">dit soia al Levi doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">dit soia al Isacar doisprãdzatsi di njilji,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />dit soia al Zabulon doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">dit soia al Iosif doisprãdzatsi di njilji,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">dit soia al Beniamin doisprãdzatsi di njilji di vulusits.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Multsãmea Atsea Marea cu Stranji Albi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Dupã aesti, vidzui unã multsãmi mari cai nu putea s-u numira vãrã, di tuti fãrili, soili, populjilji sh-limbili stãnda nãintea a thronlui sh-nãintea a Njelui, nviscuts cu stranji albi sh-tsãnea dedzi di pãlnji tu mãnjili a lor. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Elji aurla cu boatsi analtã dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Ascãparea easti a Dumnidzãlui a nostru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">tsi sheadi pri thron sh-a Njelui!”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Tuts anghilji stãtea anvãrliga di thron, di aushlji sh-di patru fãpturili atseali yii. Deapoea cãdzurã pri dintsã cu fatsa mpadi nãintea a thronlui sh-alãvdarã Dumnidzãlu, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Amin! Ghinicuvintarea, mãrirea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">frunimeatsa, hãristisirea, tinjia, fuchia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">sh-putearea suntu a Dumnidzãlui a nostru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">tu eta a etilor. Amin!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Un di aushlji lo zborlu sh-mi ntribã: “Cai suntu atselji cu stranji albi sh-di iu au vinitã?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Mini lj-apãndisii: “Doamne, tini shtii.” Atumtsea elu nji dzãsi: “Aeshti suntu atselji, tsi au vinitã dit munduirea atsea marea sh-li au aspilatã stranjili a lor sh-li au alãghit cu sãndzili a Njelui. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Trã atsea suntu nãintea a thronlui al Dumnidzãu sh-lji huzmitipsescu a lui dzua sh-noaptea tu templul a lui, iarã atsel tsi sheadi pri thron va hibã streaha a lor. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Nu va aibã ma foami, nu va aibã ma seati, nu va cadã soarili pri nãshi sh-nu va aibã vãrã pirã upuritã, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />cã Njelu, cai easti tu mesea a thronlui, va lji picurãreascã sh-va lji ducã pri izvurili a apilor a banãljei ‘sh-Dumnidzãlu va ashteargã tuti lãcrinjli di ocljilji a lor.’”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Vula a Shaptea sh-Timeanitsa di Furii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Cãndu disfeatsi vula a shaptea, tu tser s-featsi tãtseari aproapi giumitati di oarã. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Deapoea vidzui shapti anghilji cai shidea nãintea al Dumnidzãu sh-a lor lã si deadirã shapti trumpeti. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Vini sh-un altu anghil, tsi avea unã timeanitsã di furii shi stãtu la altar. A lui lji si deadi multã timeamã tra s-u dãdea deadun cu rugãciunjili a oaminjlor sãmtsã a Dumnidzãlui pri altarlu di furii tsi easti nãintea a thronlui. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Sh-fumlu a timeamãljei deadun cu rugãciunjili a sãmtsãlor, s-alinã nãintea al Dumnidzãu dit mãna a anghilui. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Atumtsea anghilu lo timeanitsa, u-umplu dit foclu a altarlui sh-u arcã pri loc. Deapoea s-featsirã bumbunidzãri, aurlãri, sfulguri sh-un cutrembur.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Trumpetili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Shapti anghilji, cai avea di shapti trumpetili, s-azãrãsirã s-asuna trumpetili. <verse eid="REV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Protlu anghil asunã trumpeta shi s-featsi grãndinã sh-foc misticat cu sãndzi. Deapoea s-arcã pri loc sh-unã a treia parti a loclui sh-unã a treia parti a ponjilor sh-tutã iarba atsea veardea s-arsi.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />A doilu anghil asunã trumpeta sh-tsiva ca un munti mari tsi s-ardea pri foc, s-arcã tu amari sh-unã a treia a amariljei s-featsi sãndzi, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />unã a treia parti a fãpturilor atsilor yii cai suntu tu amari supsirã sh-unã a treia a pamporilor s-asparsirã.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />A treilu anghil asunã trumpeta sh-dit tser cãdzu unã steauã mari, cai s-ardea ca shindanã sh-cãdzu pri unã a treia a arãurilor sh-a izvurilor di apã. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Numa a steauãljei easti “Pelin” sh-unã a treia parti a apilor s-featsi pelin sh-multsã oaminji murirã di apili, cã s-featsirã amari.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />A patru anghil asunã trumpeta shi s-agudi di unã a treia parti a soarilui, unã a treia parti a lunãljei sh-unã a treia parti a stealilor, tra si ntunica unã a treia parti a lor sh-unã a treia parti a dzuãljei s-nu lunjina ma sh-noaptea tutashã. <verse eid="REV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Deapoea vidzui sh-avdzãi boatsea a unui vultur cai azbuira tu mesea a tserlui dzãcãnda cu boatsi analtã: “Cavai, cavai, cavai di atselji tsi bãneadzã pri loc, trã itia a asunãrilor atsilor alti trumpeti, cai trelji anghilji va asunã!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s1">A Tsintsul Anghil Asunã Trumpeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />A tsintsul anghil asunã trumpeta sh-vidzui unã steauã, tsi cãdzu dit tser pri loc sh-atsilui lji si deadi cljeaia a putslui di Ahãndami. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Cãndu discljisi putslu a Ahãndamiljei, dit puts s-alinã un fum ca fumlu a unui cireap mari. Soarili sh-aera si scutidisirã di fumlu a putslui. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Dit fum ishirã carcaletsi pri loc sh-a lor lã si deadi puteari ashãtsi di cum au puteari scrachilji a loclui. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Atsilor lã si dzãsi s-nu zãrãseascã iarba a loclui, nitsi vãrã virdeatsã, nitsi vãrã pom, ma mash oaminjlji tsi nu au vula a Dumnidzãlui pri frãmtili a lor. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />A carcaletsilor nu lã si deadi volje s-lji vãtãma atselji, ma s-lji munduea di tsintsi meshi sh-dorlu a munduiriljei a lor s-eara ca ntsãparea a scraplui. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Tu atseali dzãli oaminjlji va u-caftã moartea, ma nu va u-aflã atsea. Va vor s-moarã, ma moartea va fugã di elji.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Pãrearea a carcaletsilor eara unã soi ca atsea a caljilor etimãsits trã alumtã sh-pri capitli a lor avea unã ca soi di curuni di furii sh-fatsa a lor eara ca fatsa a oaminjlor. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Perlu a lor eara ca perlu di muljeari sh-dintsilji a lor eara ca dintsilji a ljundarilor. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Avea tu cheptu un ca cheptar di her sh-vãzirea a arichilor a lor eara ca vãzirea a multor cãrutsi sh-a caljilor tsi alãga tu alumtã. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Elji avea codzi tsi undzea ca scrachi sh-ca atsi, sh-tu codzili a lor eara putearea tsi fãtsea arãu a oaminjlor di tsintsi meshi. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Ca amirã pri nãshi avea anghilu a Ahãndamiljei. Numa a lui pri uvreieshti eara “Abaddon”, iarã pri gãrtseshti eara “Apollion.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abaddon sh-Apollion va s-dzãc aspãrgãtorlu.</char></note><verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Taxiratea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Cavai” Apo 8:13.</char></note> atsea di prota tricu. Ma ia, ma yin ninga doauã taxirãtsi dupã aestã.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />A shasilu anghil asunã trumpeta sh-mini avdzãi unã boatsi di coarnili a altarlui di furii tsi easti nãintea al Dumnidzãu, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />dzãcãnda a shasilui anghil tsi avea trumpeta: “Dizleagã-lji atselji patru anghilji, cai suntu ligats la marili arãu Eufrat.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Atumtsea patru anghilji cai eara etimãsits trã atsea oarã, dzuã, mes sh-anu, s-dizligarã trã vãtãmari unã a treia parti a oaminjlor. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Numirlu a suldatsilor a cãvãlãriiljei eara njilji di njilji sh-multi njilji, lu avdzãi numirlu a lor. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Caljilji sh-cãvãlarlji tsi vidzui tu viziuni avea cheptar roshu ca fleaca, ca alabastru sh-galbinã ca schifurã. Capitli a caljilor eara ca capitli a ljundarilor sh-dit gura a lor ishea foc, fum shi schifurã. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Di aesti trei pledzi di foclu, di fumlu sh-di schifurã tsi ishea dit gura a lor s-vãtãmarã unã a treia parti a oaminjlor. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Cã putearea a caljilor eara tu gura a lor sh-tu coadzili a lor, cã coadzili a lor undzea ca nãpãrtitsli, metsi avea capiti sh-cu aesti zãrãsea. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Iarã alantsã oaminji, atselji tsi nu s-vãtãmarã di aesti pledzi, nu s-mitãnjiusirã di faptili a mãnjilor a lor shi nu dãnãsirã trã alãvdari demonjlji sh-idolji atselji di furii sh-di asimi, di bãcãr, di cheatrã sh-di lemnu, cai nu pot nitsi s-veadã, nitsi s-avdã sh-nitsi s-imnã. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Nu s-mitãnjiusirã trã vãtãmãrili a lor, nitsi trã mãyiili a lor, nitsi trã putãnsirili a lor sh-nitsi trã furãrili a lor.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Anghilu sh-Cartea Atsea Njica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Atumtsea vidzui un altu anghil puternic dipunãnda dit tser. Elu eara anvãrtit cu un nior sh-curcubeulu eara pri caplu a lui, fatsa a lui eara ca soarili sh-cicioarili a lui ca coloani di foc. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Elu tsãnea tu mãna a lui unã carti njicã discljisã sh-ciciorlu a lui atsel ndreptul l-bãgã pri amari sh-atsel stãngul l-bãgã pri loc. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Deapoea elu aurlã cu boatsi analtã cum aurlã un ljundar. Cãndu elu aurlã, di shapti bumbunidzãrili asunarã cu vãzirea a lor. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Cãndu asunarã atseali shapti bumbunidzãrili earam etimu trã scriari, ma avdzãi unã boatsi dit tser cai nji dzãsi: “Vulusea-li atseali tsi tsã dzãsirã atseali shapti bumbunidzãri shi s-nu li scrii.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Atumtsea anghilu tsi mini lu vidzui stãnda pri amari sh-pri loc, sculã mãna a lui atsea ndreapta cãtrã tser<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:40">Deut 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dan 12:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />shi si spigiurã trã atsel cai bãneadzã tu eta a etilor, cai adrã tserlu sh-atseali tsi bãneadzã tu nãsu, loclu sh-atseali tsi bãneadzã tu nãsu, amarea sh-atseali tsi suntu tu nãsã, sh-dzãsi: “Nu va aibã ma amãnari, <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />ma tu dzãlili a asunariljei a shaptilui anghil, cãndu va s-asunã trumpeta, atumtsea va si mplineascã mistiryiul al Dumnidzãu, ashãtsi di cum elu lã hãbãrsi a huzmichearilor a lui, a prufitsilor.” <verse eid="REV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Boatsea tsi avdzãi dit tser grãi nãpoi cu mini sh-nji dzãsi: “Imnã, ljea cartea atsea discljisa dit mãna a anghilui cai sta pri amari sh-pri loc.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Mini mi dush la anghilu dzãcãnda a lui s-nji dãdea cartea atsea njica. Elu nji dzãsi: “Ljea-u sh-ascapitu sh-ea va ts-amãreascã pãnticlu, iarã tu gura a ta atsea va hibã dultsi ca nyearea.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8">Ezc 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:1-3">3:1-3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Mini u loai cartea atsea njica dit mãna a anghilui, u ascãpitai sh-gura a mea eara dultsi ca njeari, ma cãndu u mãcai, pãnticlu a meu nji si featsi amari. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Atumtsea nji dzãsi: “Tini prindi s-prufitipseshti dinou trã multsi populjilji, fãri, limbi sh-amiradzi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Ier 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:4">Dan 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:15">7:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Doi Martiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Deapoea nji si deadi unã cãlami, tsi undzea ca unã bãstuni sh-nji dzãsi: “Scoalã-ti sh-misurã templul al Dumnidzãu sh-altarlu sh-numirã oaminjlji tsi s-alavdã pri nãsu. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ma uborlu di nafoarã a templui alasã nu l-misurã, cã si easti dat a pãngãnjilor sh-elji va lu calcã cu cicioari cãsãbãlu atsel sãmtu di patrudzãtsi doi di meshi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:1">Ps 79:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:18">Isa 63:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Sh-mini va lã dau puteari atsilor doi martiri a melji sh-elji va prufitipseascã di unã njilji doauã suti shaidzãtsi di dzãli nviscuts cu sac.” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Aeshti suntu atselji doi masnjilji sh-doauã shindãnjli, cai sta nãintea al Domnul a loclui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zac 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:11-14">11-14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Macã vãrã va s-lã zãrãseascã, dit gura a lor easi foc sh-lji astindzi dushmanjlji. Ashãtsi va si s-vatãmã tuts atselji cai vor s-lã facã zãrari a lor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:9">2 Sam 22:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Aeshti au puteari si ncljidã tserlu, tra s-nu da ploai tu dzãlili a prufitipsiriljei a lor, tutashã au puteari pristi apili tra s-li toarnã tu sãndzi shi s-agudeascã loclu cu itsi soi di pleagã di cãti ori vor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Amr 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Ex 17:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Cãndu s-bitiseascã mãrtiria a lor, agrul tsi s-alinã dit Ahãndamea, va s-facã alumtã cu nãshi, va lji azvingã sh-va lji vatãmã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:3">Dan 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:1">Apo 13:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Cufumãli a lor va s-hibã zãcuti pri pada a marlui cãsãbã, cai sufliteashti s-acljima Sodom sh-Eghyptu, iu s-crutsisi sh-Domnul a lor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luc 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:10">Isa 1:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Oaminjlji di populjilji, di soili, di limbili sh-di natsiunili va s-veadã cufumili a lor di trei dzãli giumitati sh-nu va s-alasã tsi cufumili a lor si s-bagã tu murmintu. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Locuitorlji a loclui va s-hãrseascã trã elji sh-va si sãrbãtoreascã sh-va pitreacã doari la un-alantu, cã aeshti doi prufits lji munduirã atselji cai bãna pri loc.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ma dupã trei dzãli shi giumitati duhlu a banãljei di la Dumnidzãlu intrã tu nãshi, sh-elji stãturã pri cicioarili a lor, sh-unã fricã mari lji acãtsã atselji tsi videa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:5">Ezc 37:5</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 37:10">10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Atumtsea elji avdzãrã unã boatsi analtã dit tser cai lã dzãsi a lor: “Alinats-vã aoa!” Sh-elji s-alinarã la tser tu nior, iarã neamitsilji a lor lã mutrea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Amr 2:11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Tu atsea oarã s-featsi un cutrembur mari sh-unã a dzatsea parti a cãsãbãlui si surpã. Di cutremburlu s-vãtãmarã shapti njilji di oaminji, iarã alantsãlji s-lãhtãrsirã sh-alãvda Dumnidzãlu a tserlui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:19-20">Ezc 38:19-20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Taxiratea a doaua tricu, ma ia, trãoarã yini taxiratea a treia.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Trumpeta a Shaptea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Anghilu a shapti asunã trumpeta sh-tu tser s-avdzãrã boatsi mãri cai dzãtsea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Amirãriljea a lumiljei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">s-featsi a Domnului a nostru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">sh-a Hristolui a lui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">sh-elu va domneascã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">tu eta a etilor.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:18">Ex 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:16">Ps 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:28">22:28</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Deapoea di patrusprãyinghits di aushi, tsi stãtea apunats pri thronurili a lor nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, cãdzurã pri dintsã sh-alãvdarã Dumnidzãlu, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Ti hãristisim, Doamne, Dumnidzãlu Tutãputut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">tsi eshti, sh-tsi earai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">cã ai loat putearea a ta atsea marea</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">sh-ahurhish s-domneshti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:3">Apo 15:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:8">Apo 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:8">4:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Natsiunili s-nãrãirã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">sh-vini nãrãirea a ta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">sh-chirolu trã giudicarea a mortsãlor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">sh-trã dari arãsplata a sclayilor a tãlji, a-prufitsilor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">a sãmtsãlor sh-atsilor tsi au fricã di numa a ta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">njitslji sh-mãrlji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">shi s-dãrãnji atselji tsi aspargã loclu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Ps 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:6">46:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Deapoea s-discljisi templul al Dumnidzãu tu tser shi s-vidzu arca a pisti-ligãturiljei a lui shi s-featsirã sfulguri, boatsi, bumbunidzãri, cutremburi sh-unã grãndinã mari.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:1">1 Amr 8:1</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 8:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:7">2 Cro 5:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Muljearea sh-Lamnja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Un semnu mari s-vidzu tu tser. Eara unã muljeari nviscut cu soarili, sh-luna eara sum cicioarili a ljei sh-pri caplu a ljei unã curunã cu doisprãdzatsi di steali. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Ea eara greauã sh-aurla di durearili a amintariljei shi s-munduia s-aminta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Isa 66:7</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:10">Mic 4:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Atumtsea tu tser s-vidzu un altu semnu. Ia, eara unã lamnji mari rosh-fleac, cai avea shapti capiti sh-dzatsi coarni sh-pri capitli a ljei avea shapti curuni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Coada a ljei trapsi unã a treia parti di stealili a tserlui sh-li arcã pri loc. Lamnja stãtu nãintea a muljeariljei cai eara trã amintari tra s-lji mãca cilimeanlu anda va aminta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan 8:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Muljearea amintã un ficior, un mascru, tsi prindea s-picurãreascã tuti fãrili cu unã veargã di her, iarã cilimeanlu a ljei s-arãchi ningã Dumnidzãlu sh-ningã thronlu a lui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:7">66:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Deapoea muljearea fudzi tu irnjii, aclo eara un loc etimãsit di Dumnidzãlu, iu s-hrãnea ea di unã njilji doauã suti shaidzãtsi di dzãli.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:2">Apo 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5">13:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Atumtsea s-featsi alumtã tu tser. Mihailu sh-anghilji a lui alumtarã contra a lamnjiljei. Alumtã sh-lamnja sh-anghilji a lui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ghini ma, lamnja nu anichisi shi loclu tu tser chiru trã nãshi. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Ashãtsi, s-arcã pri loc lamnja atsea marea, sharpili atsel vecljiul, acljimat Drac shi Satan, tsi arãdi tut lumea sh-cu nãsu s-arcarã pri loc sh-anghilji a lui.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Atumtsea avdzãi unã boatsi mari tu tser dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Tora agiumsi ascãparea sh-fuchia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui a nostru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">autoritatea a Hristolui a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">cã s-arcã n-clo acuzatorlu a fratsilor a noshtri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">atsel cai lji acuza nãintea a Dumnidzãlui a nostru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">dzua sh-noaptea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">Iac 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:1">Zac 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ma elji nichisirã pri nãsu prit sãndzili a Njelui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">sh-prit zborlu a mãririljei a lor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Sh-nu u-vrurã bana a lor pãnã tu moarti.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Trã atsea hãrsits-vã, tseruri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">sh-voi tsi bãnats tu nãshi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Cavai di loclu sh-di amarea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">cã dipunã draclu la voi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">avãnda mari inati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">metsi shti, cã ari putsãn chiro.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Cãndu lamnja vidzu cã s-arcã pri loc, priaĝuni muljearea tsi amintã cilimeanlu atsel mascru. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Ghini-ma a muljeariljei lji si deadirã doauã peani di a marlui vultur, tsi s-azboairã tu irnjii, tu loclu a ljei sh-aclo si s-hrãneascã di un chiro, di multu chiro sh-di giumitati di chiro, diparti di fatsa a sharpilui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Atumtsea sharpilu scoasi dit gura a lui dupã muljearea apã, ca arãulu, tsi ea s-lu loa arãulu. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Sh-loclu u-agiutã muljearea, discljisi gura a lui sh-ascãpitã arãulu, tsi lamnja avea scoasã dit gura a ljei. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Atumtsea lamnja s-nãrãi cu muljearea shi s-dusi s-alumta cu alantsã dit fara a ljei, cu atselji tsi tsãn dimãndãrili a Dumnidzãlui sh-au mãrtiria al Isus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:7">Apo 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:7">13:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Sh-lamnja stãtu pri arina a amariljei.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Doauã Agrinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Deapoea vidzui unã agrimi cai ishea dit amari sh-avea dzatsi coarni shi shapti capiti. Pristi coarnili a ljei avea dzatsi curunji, sh-pri capitli a ljei avea unã numã di blãstem. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Agrimea tsi vidzui undzea ca un leopardu, cicioarili a ljei eara ca cicioarili a ursãljei sh-gura a ljei ca gura a ljundarlui. Lamnja lji deadi a agrimiljei fuchia a ljei, thronlu a ljei sh-autoritati mari. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Un di capitli a ljei eara ca pliguit trã moarti, ma pleaga a ljei atsea di moarti s-vindicã. Atumtsea tuts bãnãtorlji a loclui s-ciudisirã shi s-dusirã dupã agrimea. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Oaminjlji alãvdarã lamnja, cai lji deadi autoritati a agrimiljei, sh-alãvdarã agrimea dzãcãnda: “Cai undzeashti cu agrimea sh-cai poati s-alumtã cu ea?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />A agrimiljei lji si deadi unã gurã cai greashti zboari mãri sh-blãsteami sh-lji si deadi s-avea autoritati ti lucrari di patrudzãtsi doi di meshi. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Atumtsea ea discljisi gura ti blãstimari Dumnidzãlu, ti blãstimari numa a lui sh-tenda a lui, sh-atselji tsi bãna tu tser. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />A ljei lji si deadi s-facã alumtã cu populu a Dumnidzãlui shi s-nichiseascã pristi nãshi. A ljei lji si deadi autoritati pristi cathi soi, popul, limbã sh-natsiuni. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Agrimea va u-alavdã tuts atselji cai bãneadzã pri loc, tsi numili a lor nu suntu scriati di cu adrarea a lumiljei tu cartea a banãljei a Njelui tsi easti tãljeat. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Cai ari ureclji, s-avdã!<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Macã vãrã va s-ducã tu sclãvuiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">tu sclãvuiri s-dutsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Macã vãrã va s-vatãmã cu spatã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">elu prindi si s-vatãmã cu spatã.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Aoatsi easti arãvdarea sh-pistea a popului a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Deapoea vidzui unã altã agrimi tsi ishea di pri loc. Ea avea doauã coarni tsi undzea ca coarnili a njelui, ma grea ca lamnji. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Ea ufilisea tutã autoritatea a agrimiljei atsiljei di prota nãintea a ljei sh-lu fãtsea loclu sh-locuitorlji a lui si alãvda agrimea atsea di prota tsi lji si furã vindicatã pledzili a ljei atseali di moarti. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Agrimea fãtsea seamni mãri, cãt fãtsea tsi s-dipuna sh-foc dit tser pri loc nãintea a oaminjlor. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Ea arãdea atselji cai bãna pri loc prit seamnili tsi si deadirã a ljei trã fãtseari nãintea a agrimiljei, dzãcãnda a oaminjlor tsi bãna pri loc s-lji fãtsea unã icoanã a agrimiljei, cai avea pleaga a spatãljei sh-ninga bãna. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />A agrimiljei a doaua lji si deadi fuchii trã dari duh a icoanãljei a agrimiljei di prota, ahãntu cãt icoana a agrimiljei si zbura shi s-fãtsea ashãtsi tsi si s-vãtãma tuts oaminjlji cai nu alãvda icoana a agrimiljei. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Agrimea lji featsi tuts, njitsi sh-mãri, avutsi sh-niavutsi, liberi sh-sclayi tsi s-lã si da a lor unã semnu tu mãna atsea ndreapta icã pri frãmtea a lor. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Ashãtsi, vãrã nu va s-putea s-acumpãra icã s-vindea, dicãt mash atsel tsi avea semnul, tsi easti numa a agrimiljei icã numirlu di numa a ljei.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Aoa easti frunimeatsa. Atsel tsi ari minti s-lugurseascã numirlu a agrimiljei, cã easti numirlu a unui om. Numirlu a ljei easti shasi suti shaidzãtsi shasi.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Njelu sh-Ascãpatsilji a lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Atumtsea vidzui Njelu tsi stãtea tu muntili Sion, sh-deadun cu nãsu eara unã sutã patrudzãtsi patru di njilji di oaminji tsi avea numa a lui sh-numa a Tatãlui a lui scriatã pri frãmtili a lor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:4">Apo 7:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:4">Ezc 9:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Atumtsea avdzãi unã boatsi dit tser ca shushurarea a apilor atseli multi sh-ca vrondul a unei bumbunidzari mari. Boatsea tsi avdzãi eara ca sunetul a harpilor tsi batã harpishtslji. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Elji cãnta un cãntic nou nãintea a thronlui, nãintea a patru fãpturilor sh-nãintea a aushlor. Vãrã nu putea s-lu nvitsa cãnticlu, dicãt mash atselji unã sutã patrudzãtsi patru di njilji tsi suntu arãscumpãrats dit loc. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Aeshti suntu atselji tsi nu suntu lãvushits cu muljeri, cã suntu virghini. Aeshti suntu atselji tsi urmeadzã Njelu iutsido iu s-dutsi. Elji s-acumpãrarã dit mesea a oaminjlor ca protlu frut curbãnsit trã Dumnidzãlu sh-trã Njelu, <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />sh-tu gura a lor nu s-aflã vãrã arãdeari, cã suntu fãrã cusuri.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Trei Anghilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Deapoea vidzui un altu anghil azbuirãnda tu anãltsãnjili a tserlui, tsi avea un evanghelu di daima trã dimãndari ca bunã-hãbari atsilor tsi bãneadzã pri loc, va s-dzãcã la cathi farã, la cathi soi, la cathi limbã sh-la cathi populu. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Elu dzãtsea cu boatsi analtã: “Aspãrats-vã di Dumnidzãlu sh-dats-lji a lui mãriri, cã vini oara a giudicatãljei a lui. Ncljinats-vã atsilui tsi adrã tserlu, loclu, amarea sh-izvurili a apilor.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Un altu anghil, a doilu, lu urmã dzãcãnda: “Cãdzu, cãdzu Babilonlu atsel marili, atsel tsi lji ari datã s-bea a tutã lumiljei di yinlu a inatiljei sh-a putãnsiriljei.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Un altu anghil, a treilu, lji urma dzãcãnda cu boatsi analtã: “Macã vãrã si ncljinã a agrimiljei sh-a icoaniljei a ljei sh-ljea semnul pri frãmtea icã pri mãna a lui, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />va s-bea sh-elu di yinlu a inatiljei al Dumnidzãu, tsi easti misticat nisubtsãrat tu cupa a inatiljei a lui. Elu va si s-mundueascã tu foc sh-tu schifurã nãintea a sãmtsãlor anghilj sh-nãintea a Njelui. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Fumlu a munduirilor a lor va si s-alinã tu eta a etilor, sh-nu va aibã arihati dzua sh-noaptea atselji tsi si ncljinã a agrimiljei sh-a icoaniljei a ljei sh-caitsido tsi ljea semnul a numãljei a ljei.” <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Aoatsi easti arãvdarea a popului a Dumnidzãlui, atsilor tsi li veaglji dimãndãrili al Dumnidzãu sh-pistea al Isus.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Atumtsea avdzãi unã boatsi dit tser tsi nji dzãtsea: “Scrii: Ca hara di mortsãlji, di atselji tsi moarã trã Domnul di tora sh-nclo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">“Ie,” dzãtsi Duhlu, “tra si s-arihãtipseascã di apustusirili a lor, cã faptili a lor lji urmeadzã di nãpoi.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sitsirarea sh-Adunarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Deapoea vidzui un nior albu sh-prisupru a niorlui shidea apunat un, tsi undzea ca hiljilu a omlui, tsi avea pri caplu a lui unã curuni di furii sh-tu mãna a lui tsãnea unã seatsirã struxitã. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Un altu anghil ishi dit templu aurlãnda cu boatsi analtã cãtrã atsel tsi shidea pri nior: “Ljea seatsira a ta sh-seatsirã, cã vini chirolu trã sitsirari, cã s-coapsi sitsirãtura a loclui.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Ashã elu tsi shãdea pri nior u mina mãna cu seatsira pri loc shi loclu fu sitsirat.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Dit templu tsi eara tu tser ishi un altu anghil, sh-elu avea unã seatsirã struxitã. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Un altu anghil tsi avea puteari pri foc ishi dit altar sh-lji gri cu boatsi analtã atsilui tsi avea seatsira atsea struxitã dzãcãnda: “Ljea seatsira a ta atsea struxita sh-adunã areapinjli a ayinjiljei a loclui, cã s-coapsi aua a ljei.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Anghilu u minã mãna cu seatsira pri loc, sh-adunã aua a loclui sh-u arcã tu voza atsea marea a inatiljei al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Atsea tsi era nãuntru tu vozã s-cãlcã nafoarã dit cãsãbã sh-dit vozã ishi sãndzi tsi agiundzea pãnã la fãrnili a caljilor shi s-timsi di doauã suti di milji.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 600 di stadi easti 200 milje.</char></note><verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Shapti Anghilji shi Shapti Pledzili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Deapoea vidzui tu tser un altu semnu mari sh-thãvmãtisit: shapti anghilji tsi avea shapti pledzi, atseali di ma napoi, cã cu eali s-bitisi inatea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Sh-vidzui tsiva ca amari di chelchi misticatã cu foc sh-atselji tsi nichisirã pristi agrimea, pristi icoana a ljei sh-pristi numirlu a numãljei a ljei, stãnda pri amarea di chelchi sh-avãnda harpili dati di Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Elji cãnta cãnticlu al Moisiu, huzmichearlu al Dumnidzãu, sh-cãnticlu a Njelui, dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Mãri sh-thãvmãtisiti suntu faptili a tali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Doamne, Dumnidzale Tutãpututul!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ndreapti sh-alihioasi suntu cãljurili a tali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Amirãlu a natsiunilor!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Cai nu va aibã fricã di tini, Doamne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">sh-nu va s-mãreascã numa a ta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Mash tini eshti sãmtu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Cã tuti fãrili va yinã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">sh-va si ncljinã nãintea a ta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">cã faptili a tali atseali ndreapti s-fãnirusirã.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Dupã aesti lucri mini mutrii tu tser shi s-discljisi templul, tsi easti tenda a mãririljei. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Dit templu ishirã shapti anghilji tsi avea shapti pledzili. Elji eara nviscuts cu stranji curati di ljin sh-anvãrliga di cheptu cu brãni di furii. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Unã di patru fãpturili lã deadi a shapti anghilor shapti cupi di furii umpluti cu inatea al Dumnidzãu, atsilui tsi bãneadzã tu eta a etilor. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Templul s-umplu cu fum di mãrirea al Dumnidzãu sh-di fuchia a lui sh-vãrã nu putea s-intra tu templu pãnã cãndu s-bitisea shapti pledzili atsilor shapti anghilji.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Shapti Cupili di Inati al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Deapoea avdzãi unã boatsi analtã dit templu cai dzãtsea atsilor shapti anghilji: “Njidzets sh-virsats pri loc atseali shapti cupili a inatiljei al Dumnidzãu!” <verse eid="REV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />S-dusi protlu, u-virsã cupa a lui pri loc. Atumtsea unã pleagã urutã sh-durutã lã acãtsã tuts oaminjlji tsi avea semnul a agrimiljei shi si ncljina la icoana a ljei.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />A doilu anghil u-virsã cupa a lui tu amari sh-amarea s-prifeatsi ca sãndzili a unui om mortu sh-cathi fãpturã dit amari supsi.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />A treilu anghil u-virsã cupa a lui tu arãuri sh-tu izvurili a apilor sh-eali s-prifeatsirã sãndzi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Sh-avdzãi anghilu a apilor dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“Tini eshti ndreptu, Doamne, tsi eshti sh-tsi earai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">atsel Sãmtul tsi giudicash aesti lucri.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Cã elji virsarã sãndzili a sãmtsãlor sh-a prufitsilor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">sh-tini lã dãdeshi a lor s-bea sãndzi, cã u axizescu.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Deapoea avdzãi unã boatsi dit altar dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Ie, Doamne, Dumnidzale Tutãputute,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">alihioasi sh-ndreapti suntu giudicãtsili a tali.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />A patrul anghil u virsã cupa a lui pristi soarili sh-a soarilui lji si deadi s-dugurea oaminjlji pri foc. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Sh-oaminjlji s-dugurirã di pira atsea marea sh-blãstimarã numa al Dumnidzãu, atsilui tsi ari puteari pri aesti pledzi sh-elji nu s-mitãnjiusirã trã dari a lui mãriri.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />A tsintsul anghil u virsã cupa a lui pristi thronlu a agrimiljei sh-amirãriljea a ljei s-featsi scutidi, sh-oaminjlji mushca limbili a lor di durearea. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Elji blãstimarã Dumnidzãlu a tserlui trã itia a durerilor sh-a pledzilor a lor, ma nu s-mitãnjiusirã trã faptili a lor.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />A shasilu anghil u virsã cupa a lui tu arãulu atsel marili Eufrat sh-apili a lui si astrãchirã tra si etimãseascã calea a amiradzlor tsi yin di arãsãrita a soarilui. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Deapoea vidzui s-ishea dit gura a lamnjiljei, dit gura a agrimiljei sh-dit gura a prufitlui arãdios trei duhuri nicurati ca broashti. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Atseali suntu duhuri di demonji tsi fac seamni, tsi easã cãtrã amiradzlji a lumiljei ntreagã, tra s-lji adunã trã alumtari tu dzua atsea marea a Dumnidzãlui a Tutãpututul.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Ia, ma yin ca fur! Ca hara di atsel tsi sta dishtiptat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:15">sh tsãni nviscut stranjili a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:15">tra s-nu imnã dispuljeat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:15">shi si s-veadã arushinea a lui.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Sh-duhurili lji adunarã amiradzlji tu loclu tsi pi uvreieshti s-acljeamã “Armaghedon”.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />A shaptilu anghilu virsã cupa a lui tu vimtu sh-unã boatsi analtã ishi dit templu, dit thron sh-dzãsi: “S-bitisi.” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Atumtsea s-featsirã sfulguri, aurlãri sh-bumbunidzãri shi s-featsi un cutrembur mari. Ahtar cutrembur nu fu faptã vãrã oarã di cãndu s-featsi omlu pristi loc. Ahãt cutrembur mari eara. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Cãsãbãlu atsel marli s-dispãrtsã tu trei pãrtsi sh-cãsãbadzli a natsiunilor cãdzurã. Dumnidzãlu adusi aminti Babilonlu atsel marili, tra s-lji u-da a lui cupa a yinlui a mariljei inati a lui. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Tuti insulili chirurã, sh-muntsãlji nu s-aflarã ma. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Dit tser apãrnji s-cãdea pri oaminjlji unã grãndinã mari sh-greauã di tsindzãtsi di chiladz. Oaminjlji blãstima Dumnidzãlu trã pleaga a grãndinãljei, cã pleaga a lui eara multu di multu mari.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Muljearea sh-Agrimea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Deapoea vini un di shapti anghilji, tsi avea di shapti cupãli, zburã cu mini sh-nji dzãsi: “Haidi, va tsã spun giudicata a putanãljei atsiljei mari, tsi sheadi ningã apãli atseali multi. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Cu ea putãnsirã amiradzlji a loclui sh-cu yinlu a putãnsiriljei a ljei si mbitarã bãnãtorlji a loclui.” <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Sh-elu mi dusi tu irnjii arãchit di Duhlu. Aclo vidzui unã muljeari tsi shidea apunat pristi unã agrimi aroshi-fleacã, mplini cu numi di blãsteami sh-avea shapti capiti sh-dzatsi coarni. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Muljearea eara nviscut cu purpuri sh-cu aroshi-fleacã, stulisit cu furii, cu chetri scumpi sh-cu mãrgãritãri. Tu mãnã avea unã cupã di furii mplinã cu lãvushituri sh-cu pãngãniturili a putãnsiriljei a ljei. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Pri frãmtea a ljei eara scriatã unã numã, un mistiryiu: “Babilonlu atsel marili, muma a putãnilor shi a lãvushiturilor a loclui.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Deapoea vidzui muljearea mbitatã di sãndzili a sãmtsãlor sh-di sãndzili a martirilor al Isus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Cãndu u vidzui ea, mi ciudisii multã. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Atumtsea anghilu nji dzãsi: “Trã tse ti ciudiseshti? Mini va tsã spun mistiryiul a muljeariljei sh-a agrimiljei tsi u tsãni ea, atsiljei cai ari shapti capiti sh-dzatsi coarni. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Agrimea, tsi u-vidzushi, eara, ma nu easti ma, va si s-alinã dit Ahãndamea, shi va s-ducã tu chireari. Bãnãtorlji a loclui, a cãror numi nu suntu scriati tu cartea a banãljei di la timiljearea a lumiljei, va s-ciudiseascã anda va s-veadã agrimea, tsi eara sh-nu easti ma, cu tutã cã va yin. <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Atselji tsi au frunimeatsã, u achicãseascã. Shapti capitli suntu shapti muntsã, iu sheadi muljearea pri nãshi, shi suntu shapti amiradzi. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Tsintsi di nãshi au cãdzutã, un easti sh-alantu nu ari vinitã ninga, ma cãndu s-yinã di putsãnã chiro va sta. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Agrimea, tsi eara sh-nu easti ma tora, easti sh-ea tu a optul amirã, easti di atselji shapti, ma sh-ea s-dutsi cãtrã chireari.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Dzatsi coarnili tsi vidzushi suntu dzatsi amiradzi, tsi nu au loatã ninga amirãriljea, ma va s-ljea puteari ca amiradzi trã unã oarã deadun cu agrimea. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Aeshti au unã singur nãeti sh-fuchia sh-putearea a lor lji-u da a agrimiljei. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Aeshti va s-alumtã cu Njelu, ma Njelu va lji azvingu, cã elu easti Domnul a domnjilor sh-Amirã a amiradzlor sh-atselji tsi suntu cu nãsu suntu acljimats aleptsã sh-pistimenji.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Deapoea anghilu nji dzãsi a njia: “Apili tsi vidzushi, iu sheadi apunatã putana, suntu populjilji, multsãnji, fãri sh-limbi. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Dzatsi coarnili tsi vidzushi sh-agrimea, aeshti va u-aurascã putana, sh-va u alasã shcretã sh-dispuljeat. Va s-mãcã carnea a ljei sh-va u ardã n-foc. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Cã Dumnidzãlu bãgã tu ininjli a lor s-facã nãetea a lui shi apofãsi s-lji da amirãriljea a lor a agrimiljei, pãnã cãndu si mplineascã zboarili a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Sh-muljearea tsi vidzushi, easti cãsãbãlu atsel marli, atsel tsi ari domnilji pristi amiradzlji a loclui.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Jali trã Cãdearea a Babilonlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Deapoea vidzui un altu anghil cai dipuna dit tser, avea puteari mari, sh-loclu s-lunjinã di mãrirea a lui. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Atumtsea anghilu aurlã cu boatsi analtã dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“Cãdzu, cãdzu Babilonlu atsel marili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">shi s-featsi casa a demonjilor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">streahã trã tuti duhurili nicurati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">streahã trã itsi puljiu nicurat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">shi streahã trã itsi agrimi nicurat sh-aurãt.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa 21:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Cã di yinlu a orixiljei a putãnsiriljei a ljei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">au biutã tuti fãrili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">sh-amiradzlji a loclui s-putãnsirã cu ea</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">sh-pãrmãteftsãlji a loclui s-avutsãrã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">di chefea a ljei vãrtoasã.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Deapoea avdzãi unã altã boatsi dit tser dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Ishits dit ea, populu a meu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">tra s-nu vã fãtsets pãrtashi cu amãrtiili a ljei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">shi s-nu loats di pledzili a ljei.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Cã amãrtiili a ljei agiumsirã pãnã la tser</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:5">sh-Dumnidzãlu adusi aminti nindriptãtsili a ljei.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Arãsplãtits-lji a ljei ashã cum arãsplãti sh-ea alantsãlji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">sh-plãtits-lji dublu dupã faptili a ljei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">tu cupa tsi ea lã-u minti a alantsãlor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">mintits-lji-u sh-voi di doauã ori ma multu.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ahãt cãt lji deadi ea mãriri a inimãljei shi s-deadi dupã chefea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">ahãt munduiri shi jali dats-lji sh-voi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">cã cu inima a ljei ea dzãtsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">‘Mini shed ca amirãroanji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">ma veduvã nu escu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">shi jali nu va ved dip.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Trã atsea tu unã singurã dzuã va yinã pledzili a ljei:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">moartea, vãitarea sh-foami di pãni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">sh-va si s-ardã ntreagã tu foc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">cã putut easti Domnul Dumnidzãlu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">atsel tsi u giudicã.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Sh-va u plãngã sh-va vãiteascã trã ea amiradzlji a loclui, atselji tsi s-putãnsirã cu ea shi s-deadirã dupã chefea cu ea, cãndu s-veadã fumlu a ardeariljei a ljei. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Elji va sta diparti di frica a munduiriljei a ljei dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“Cavai, cavai cãsãbãlu atsel marli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Babilonlu cãsãbã putut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">cã tu unã singur oarã vini giudicata a ta!”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Sh-pãrmãteftsãlji a loclui va plãngu sh-va vãitescu trã ea, cã vãrã nu va u-acumpãrã ma pãrmãtia a lor: <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />pãrmãtii di furii sh-di asimi, chetri scumpi sh-mãrgãritãri, pãndzã di ljin sh-di purpurã, mitasi sh-stranji roshi-apreasi sh-turli di leamni tsi anjiurdzescu, multi lucri di fildish sh-turlii lucri di lemnu multu scumpu, tungiu, heru sh-marmarã, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />canelã, amom, timeamã, njir sh-livandu ayiusit, yin, untulemnu di masni, fãrinã, grãn, prãvdzã, oi, calji, cãrutsili shi suflitli di oaminji vinduts ca sclayi.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Sh-frutlu tsi tini lu arsish tu suflitlu a tãu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">fudzi di la tini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">sh-tuti lucrili luxoazi shi strãlutsiti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">fudzirã di la tini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">sh-tini nu va li aflã ma vãrã oarã.<verse eid="REV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Pãrmãteftsãlji aishtor lucri, tsi s-featsirã avuts di la ea, va sta diparti di frica a munduiriljei a ljei, plãngãnda, vãitãnda, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />sh-dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">“Cavai! Cavai! Cãsãbãlu atsel marli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">tini tsi earai nviscut cu pãndzã di ljin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">sh-purpurã sh-cu aroshi-apreasã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">stulisitã cu furii, cu chetri scumpi sh-cu mãrgãritãri,<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />cã di unã oarã singurã si shcretui tutã aestã ayishteari!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Tuts timonierilji sh-tuts atselji tsi nãftãsea cãtrã un loc, naftsãlji sh-tuts cãt lucreadzã pri amari, stãturã diparti <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />sh-mutrinda fumlu a ardeariljei a ljei, grirã: “Cai cãsãbã lji undzea aishtui cãsãbã mari?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Sh-arcarã pulbiri pristi capitli a lor, sh-grirã plãngãnda sh-vãitãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“Cavai! Cavai! Cãsãbãlu atsel marli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">la cai tuts s-featsirã avuts atselji</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">tsi avea pampori pri amari di ayishtearea a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">cã tu unã oarã singurã s-asparsi!<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Hãrsea-ti di ea tini tser,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">sh-voi populu a Dumnidzãlui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">apostulji sh-prufits,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">cã Dumnidzãlu giudicã cãsãbãlu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">di cum sh-cãsãbãlu vã giudicã voi.”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Deapoea un anghil vãrtos sculã unã cheatrã mari cãt unã cheatrã di moarã sh-u arcã tu amari, dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Cu ahtari agunjii va si s-arucã Babilonlu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">atsel marli cãsãbã sh-nu va si s-aflã ma.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Asunarea a harpilor sh-a muzicantsilor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">atsilor tsi bat flueara sh-trumbetili</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">nu va si s-avdã vãrã oarã ma tu tini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Vãrã mastru ti itsi lucru nu va si s-aflã ma tu tini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">sh-asunarea di boatsea a moarãljei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">nu va si s-avdã ma tu tini.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Lunjina a cãndilãljei nu va lunjineadzã ma tu tini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">sh-boatsi di dzinir sh-di nveastã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">nu va si s-avdã ma tu tini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">cã pãrmãteftsãlji a tãlji eara mãrlji a loclui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">sh-tuti fãrili s-arãsirã di mãyiia a ta.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Tu tini s-aflã sãndzili a prufitsilor sh-a popului a Dumnidzãlui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:24">sh-a tuts atsilor tsi eara tãljeats pri loc.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Aleluia, Hãrsiri tu Tser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Deapoea dupã aesti avdzãi ca unã boatsi analtã di unã multsãmi mari tu tser dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Ascãparea sh-mãrirea sh-putearea</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">suntu a Dumnidzãlui a nostru!<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Cã alihioasi sh-ndreapti suntu giudicãtsili a lui!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Elu u giudicã putana atsea marea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">cai asparsi loclu cu putãnsirea a ljei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">shi s-ari arãzgãnatã trã sãndzili a huzmichearilor a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">virsat di mãna a ljei.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Sh-di a doaua oarã dzãsirã: “Aleluia! Sh-fumlu a cãsãbãlui s-alinã tu eta a etilor.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Atumtsea di patrusprãyinghits aushlji sh-patru fãpturili cãdzurã pri dintsã shi si ncljinarã a Dumnidzãlui cai eara apunat pri thron, dzãcãnda: “Amin, Aleluia!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Atumtsea dit thron ishi unã boatsi, dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Alãvdats Dumnidzãlu a nostru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">tuts voi huzmichearlji a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">sh-voi tsi avets fricã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">njitsi sh-mãri.”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Numta a Njelui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Deapoea avdzãi unã boatsi ca di unã multsãmi mari, ca vãzirea a apilor sh-ca boatsi di mãri bumbunidzãri tsi dzãtsea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Cã amirãri Domnul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Dumnidzãlu a nostru atsel Tutãpututul!<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />S-nã hãrsim, si sãrbãtorim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">shi s-lji u-dãm mãrirea a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">cã vini numta a Njelui</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">sh-nveasta a lui si ndreapsi!<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Lji si deadi a ljei si nveascã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:8">cu pãndzã di ljin lunjinatã sh-chischin.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">(Cã pãndza di ljin spuni trã faptili atseali ndreapti a popului a Dumnidzãlui).<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Deapoea anghilu nji dzãsi: “Scrii: Ca hara di atselji tsi suntu acljimats pi uspetsi la numta a Njelui.” Sh-adãvgã: “Aesti suntu zboarili alihioasi a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Atumtsea mini cãdzui pri dintsã nãintea a cicioarilor a lui tra s-mi ncljinu, iarã elu nji dzãsi: “Vedz s-nu u fats, mini escu huzmichear deadun cu tini sh-cu fratslji a tãlji, tsi au mãrtiria al Isus. La Dumnidzãlu s-ti ncljinji! Cã mãrtiria a Isusului easti duhlu a prufitsiiljei.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cãvãlarlu pi Cal Albu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Deapoea vidzui tserlu discljis, sh-ia, un cal albu, sh-cãvãlarlu tsi eara pri nãsu tsi s-acljima Pistimen sh-Alihios. Elu giudicã sh-alumtã cu ndriptati. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ocljilji a lui eara ca fleaca a foclui sh-pri caplu a lui avea multi curunji. Aclo avea scriatã unã numã, cai nu u shtia vãrã altu dicãt mash elu. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Eara nviscut cu stranji aumti tu sãndzi sh-numa a lui eara “Zborlu a Dumnidzãlui”. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Armata a tserlui lu urma ncãlicat pri calji alghi, nviscuts cu pãndzã di ljin albã sh-chischin. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Dit gura a lui ishea unã spatã struxitã cu cai s-agudea natsiunili. Elu va lji picurãreascã cu bãstun di her sh-va calcã voza a yinlui a turbariljei al Dumnidzãu Tutãpututul. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Pri stranji sh-pri coapsa a lui avea scriatã unã numã:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">Amirãlu a Amiradzlor sh-Domnul a Domnjilor.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Deapoea vidzui un anghil tsi stãtea tu soari sh-aurlã cu boatsi analtã, dzãcãnda a tuts puljilor, tsi azbuira tu mesea a tserlui:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:17">“Haidets, adunats-vã tu tsina atsea marea a Dumnidzãlui,<verse eid="REV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />tra s-mãcats carni di amiradzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:18">di comandantsi, di oaminji vãrtoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:18">carni di calji sh-di cãvãlari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:18">sh-di carnea a tuts oaminjlor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:18">atsilor liberi sh-atsilor sclayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:18">a njitsilor sh-a mãrlor.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Atumtsea vidzui agrimea sh-amiradzlji a loclui cu armatili a lor adunati tra s-fãtsea alumtã cu atsel tsi cãlãrea pri cal sh-cu armata a lui. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ma agrimea s-acãtsã sh-deadun cu nãsã sh-prufitlu arãdios, atsel tsi nãintea a ljei featsi seamnili, cu cai s-arãsirã atselji tsi loarã vula a agrimiljei sh-atselji tsi si ncljinarã la icoana a ljei. Di doilji s-arcarã yii tu laclu a foclui tsi s-ardi cu schifurã. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Alantsãlji s-vãtãmarã di spata tsi ishea dit gura atsilui cai eara pri cal, sh-tuts puljilji s-fãnãtirã cu carna a lor.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Amirãrilja di Unã Njilji di Anji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Deapoea vidzui un anghil tsi dipuna dit tser. Elu avea cljeaia a Ahãndamiljei sh-un singir mari tu mãna a lui. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Elu u acãtsã lamnja, nãpãrtica atsea veacljea tsi easti draclu shi Satanlu, sh-u ligã di unã njilji di anji. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />U-arcã tu Ahãndami, u ncljisi sh-u vulusi tra s-nu arãdea ma natsiunili, pãnã cãndu s-treacã unã njilji di anji. Ma napoea elu prindi si s-dizleagã di putsãn chiro.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Deapoea vidzui thronuri pristi iu shidzurã atselji a cui si deadi autoritatea s-facã giudicata. Deapoea vidzui suflitli a lor tsi lã si eara tãljeat capitli trã itia a mãririljei al Isus sh-trã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui tsi nu si eara ncljinatã a agrimiljei sh-a icoanãljei a ljei sh-nu avea loatã vulã pri frãmti sh-pri mãna a lor. Elji s-turnarã tu banã sh-domnirã cu Hristolu trã unã njilji di anji. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Alantsã mortsã nu s-turnarã tu banã pãnã cãndu si mplinirã unã njilji di anji. Aestã easti nyearea di prota. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ghinicuvintat sh-sãmtu easti atsel cai ari parti tu nyearea di prota. Pristi elji, moartea a doaua nu ari puteari, ma va s-hibã preftsãlji a Dumnidzãlui sh-a Hristolui sh-va s-domneascã cu elu di unã njilji di anji.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Giudicarea al Satan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Cãndu si mplineascã unã njilji di anji, Satanlu va si s-dizleagã dit hapsi, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />sh-va s-easã s-arãdã fãrili di patru pãrtsãli a loclui, Gogul sh-Magogul, tsi s-li adunã la alumtã. Numirlu a lor va s-hibã ca arina a amariljei. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Elji s-alinarã pri tuti pãrtsãli a loclui shi anvãrligarã pada a popului sãmtu a Dumnidzãlui sh-cãsãbãlu atsel vrutlu. Deapoea dit tser dipunã foc sh-lji afãnisi. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Atumtsea draclu tsi lã-arãdea, s-arcã tu laclu di foc sh-di schifurã, iu eara agrimea sh-prufitlu atsel arãdios. Aclo va s-mundueascã dzua sh-noaptea tu eta a etilor.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Giudicari Nãintea a Thronlui Albu Atsel Marli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Deapoea vidzui un thron mari, albu sh-atsel cai shidea pri nãsu, dit fatsa a cui s-afãnisirã loclu sh-tserlu sh-nu s-aflã ma loc ti elji. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Vidzui sh-mortsãlji, njitsi sh-mãri, tsi stãtea nãintea a thronlui. Atumtsea cãrtsili s-discljisirã. S-discljisi sh-unã altã carti cai easti cartea a banãljei. Mortsãlji s-giudicarã dupã atseali tsi eara scriati tu cãrtsi, dupã faptili a lor. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Amarea lji deadi mortsãlji tsi eara tu nãsã. Moartea sh-Colasea lji deadirã mortsãlji tsi eara cu nãshi. Cathiunu s-giudicã dupã faptili a lui. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Deapoea moartea sh-Colasea s-arcarã tu laclu a foclui. Aestã easti moartea a doaua, laclu a foclui. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Sh-macã vãrã nu s-aflã scriat tu cartea a banãljei, s-arcã tu laclu a foclui.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Tserlu Atsel Noulu sh-Loclu Atsel Noulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Deapoea vidzui un tser nou sh-un loc nou. Tserlu di prota sh-loclu di prota s-dusirã sh-amarea nu easti ma. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Deapoea vidzui Cãsãbãlu atsel Sãmtu, Ierusalemlu atsel noulu dipunãnda dit tser, di la Dumnidzãlu sh-eara azãrãsitã ca nveastã stulisit trã dzinirli a ljei. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Atumtsea avdzãi unã boatsi analtã dit thron cai dzãtsea: “Ia, tenda a Dumnidzãlui easti cu oaminjlji! Sh-elu va s-bãneadzã cu nãshi sh-elji va hibã populu a lui. Idyiul Dumnidzãlu va s-hibã deadun cu elji. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Dumnidzãlu va ashteargã cathi lacrimã dit ocljilji a lor, sh-moartea nu va hibã ma, nitsi jali, nitsi vãitari, nitsi dureari nu va aibã ma, cã atseali di prota tricurã.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Atsel tsi shidea pri thron dzãsi: “Ia, mini ma li fac tuti noauã.” Deapoea nj-dzãsi: “Scrii, cã aesti zboari suntu pistipsiti sh-alihioasi.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Sh-nji dzãsi: “S-featsi! Mini escu Alfa sh-Omega, Apãrnjita sh-Bitisita! Mini va-lji dau ca doarã atsilui tsi ari seati dit izvurlu a apãljei a banãljei. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Cai amintã, va li mushtineadzã tuti aesti. Mini va lji hiu a lui Dumnidzãu sh-elu va ni hibã a njia hiljiu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Iarã fricoshilji sh-nipistimenjlji, aĝnoshilji sh-vãtãmãtorlji, putãnjsitorlji sh-mãghipsitorilji, iduljitorlji sh-tuts arãditorilji va aibã partea a lor tu laclu tsi s-ardi cu foc sh-cu schifurã, cai easti moartea a doaua.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ierusalemlu Atsel Noulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Deapoea vini un di shapti anghilji, cai avea shapti cupãli mplini cu shapti pledzili dit soni shi zburã cu mini dzãcãnda: “Haidi, va tsã spun nveasta, muljearea a Njelui.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Atumtsea mi dusi cu Duhlu pri un munti mari sh-analtu, shi nj-aspusi Cãsãbãlu atsel Sãmtu, Ierusalemlu, tsi dipuna dit tser di la Dumnidzãlu, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />avãnda mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui. Strãlutsirea a lui undzea ca unã cheatrã multã scumpã, ca cheatrã di iaspi, ca cristalu curat. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Cãsãbãlu avea un mur mari sh-analtu cai avea doauãsprãdzatsi di portsã sh-pri portsã doisprãdzatsi di anghilji sh-pri nãshi numi scriati, tsi eara numili atsilor doisprãdzatsi di soi a hiljilor al Israel. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Cãtrã rãsãrit avea trei portsã, cãtrã nord avea trei portsã, cãtrã sud avea trei portsã, cãtrã ascãpitatã avea trei portsã. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Murlu a cãsãbãlui avea doisprãdzatsi di thimelji sh-pri thimelji numili atsilor doisprãdzatsi apostulji a Njelui.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Anghilu cai zbura cu mini avea un cãlami di furii ti misurari cãsãbãlu, portsãli a lui sh-murlu a lui. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Cãsãbãlu avea forma a unui pãtrat sh-lundzimea a lui eara cãtã lãrdzimea. Elu misurã cãsãbãlu cu cãlamlu sh-eara doisprãdzatsi di njilji di stadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">12 000 stadi easti 2 400 km.</char></note> Lundzimea, lãrdzimea sh-anãltsimea a lui eara unã soi. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Misurã sh-murlu a lui sh-eara unã sutã patrudzãtsi sh-patru di cots, cu misurarea umineascã, tsi easti sh-misura a anghilui. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Adãrãmintul a murlui a lui eara di iaspi, sh-cãsãbãlu eara di furii curatã, unã soi ca chelchi curatã. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Timeljiu la murlu a cãsãbãlui eara stulisiti cu multi soi di chetri scumpi. Protlu timeljiu eara di iaspi, a doilu di safir, a treilu di calcedonu, a patrulu eara di smeraldu, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />a tsintsilu di sardonix, a shasilu di sard, a shaptilu di crisolit, a optulu di beril, a noaulu di topaz, a dzatsilu di hrizopraz, a unsprãdzatsilu di iachintu, a doisprãdzatsilu di ametistu. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Doauãsprãdzatsili di portsã eara doauãsprãdzatsi di mãrgãritãri, cathi poartã eara di un mãrgãritar singur, sh-pada a cãsãbãlui eara di furii curatã, ca chelchi transparentã. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Sh-nu vidzui nitsiun templu tu cãsãbã, cã Domnul Dumnidzã atsel Tutãpututlu easti templu a lui di cum easti sh-Njelu. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Cãsãbãlu nu ari ananghi di soari, nitsi di lunã tsi s-lunjineadzã tu nãsu, cã mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui lunjineadzi trã nãsu sh-lamba a lui easti Njelu. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Natsiunili va s-imnã tu lunjina a lui sh-amiradzlji a loclui va aducã mãrirea a lor la nãsu. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Portsãli a lui nu va si s-ncljidã pute dzua, cã aclo nu va aibã vãrãoarã noapti. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Aclo tu cãsãbã va si s-aducã mãrirea sh-tinjia a fãrilor. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Tu cãsãbã nu va intrã tsiva pãnĝãnit sh-vãrã tsi s-pãnĝãneashti sh-arãdi, ma mash atselji tsi suntu scriats tu cartea a bãnãljei a Njelui.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Arãulu sh-Pomlu a Banãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Deapoea anghilu nji spusi arãulu atsel alimtu di apa a bãnãljei, cai strãlutsea ca cristalu sh-izvurlu dit thronlu al Dumnidzãu sh-a Njelui. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Tu mesea a padãljei a cãsãbãlui dit doauli pãrtsãli a arãului, eara pomlu a bãnãljei cai da doisprãdzatsi di fruti, cathi mesu cãtã un frut, sh-frãndzãli a pomlui suntu ti vindicarea a natsiunilor. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Nu va s-aibã ma nitsiun blãstem. Tu cãsãbã va s-hibã thronlu al Dumnidzãu sh-a Njelui, sh-huzmichearlji a lui va s-lji huzmitipseascã. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Elji va s-veadã fatsa a lui, sh-numa a lui va s-hibã pri frãmtili a lor. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Noapti nu va s-aibã ma sh-nu va s-aibã ananghi di lunjina a lambadãljei, sh-nitsi di lunjina a soarilui, cã Domnul Dumnidzãlu va li lunjineadzã sh-va s-domneascã tu eta a etilor.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Prihãbãrsirea di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Deapoea anghilu nji dzãsi: “Aesti zboari suntu pistipsiti sh-alihioasi. Domnul, Dumnidzãlu tsi lã da Duhlu a prufitsilor,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Icã “Dumnidzãlu a duhurilor a prufitsilor”. </char></note> pitricu anghilu a lui tra s-lã aspunã a huzmichearilor a lui atseali tsi va s-undzeascã tora-curundu.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Ia, mini ma yin curundu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:7">Ca hara di atsel tsi veaglji zboarili a prufitsiiljei a cartiljei aishtei.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Mini, Ioanul, escu atsel cai li avdzãi sh-li vidzui aesti lucri. Dupã tsi li avdzãi sh-li vidzui, cãdzui pri dintsã tra s-mi ncljin nãintea a cicioarilor a anghilui tsi nji-li spunea aesti lucri. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Sh-elu nji dzãsi: “Vedz, s-nu u fatsi aestã! Cã mini escu huzmichear ca tini sh-ca fratslji a tãlji prufits sh-atsilor tsi li tsãn zboarili a cartiljei aishtei. Ncljinã-ti mash a Dumnidzãlui!” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Deapoea nji dzãsi: “Nu vulusea zboarãli a prufitsiiljei a cartiljei aishtei, cã chirolu easti aproapi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Nindreptul s-facã ninga nindriptati, pãnĝãnitulu si s-pãnĝãneascã ninga, ndreptul s-facã ninga ndriptati shi sãmtul si sãmtseascã ninga.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Ia, mini yin trãoarã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:12">sh-plata a mea easti cu mini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:12">tra s-lji da a cathiunui dupã faptili a lui.<verse eid="REV 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Mini escu Alfa sh-Omega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:13">atsel dit prota sh-atsel dit soni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:13">Apãrnjita sh-Bitisita.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Ca hara di atselji tsi aspealã stranjili a lor, cã va s-aibã ndreptul s-mãcã dit pomlu a banãljei shi s-intrã tu poarta a cãsãbãlui. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Nafoarã suntu cãnjilji, mãghipsitorilji, putãnjsitorlji, vãtãmãtorlji, iduljitorlji sh-caitsido tsi va sh-ufiliseashti arãdearea.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Mini, Isusul, pitricui anghilu a meu tra s-vã mãrtirseascã aesti lucri trã biseritsli. Mini escu arãdãtsina sh-fara al David, steaua atsea lutsita a dimineatsãljei.” <verse eid="REV 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Duhlu sh-Nveasta dzãc: “Haidi!” Atsel tsi avdi prindi s-dzãcã: “Haidi!” Cai ari seati, s-yinã, sh-atsel tsi va, s-ljea ca doarã apa a bãnãljei.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Mini ma vã mãrtirsescu a tuts atsilor cai ascultã zboarili a prufitsiiljei a cartãljei aishtei: macã vãrã va s-adavgã tsiva atsilor, Dumnidzãlu va s-adavgã pri elji pledzili scriati tu aestã carti. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Atsilui tsi va scoatã tsiva dit zboarili a cartãljei aishtei prufitsii, Dumnidzãlu nu va lji da partea a lui dit pomlu a banãljei, dit Cãsãbãlu atsel Sãmtu, tsi suntu scriati tu aestã carti.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Atsel tsi mãrtirseashti trã aesti dzãtsi: “Ie, mini yin trãoarã.” Amin. Haidi, Doamne Isus! <verse eid="REV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Harul a Domnului Isus s-hibã cu voi tuts! Amin!<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>